# Rules & context — `LUAT_VA_BOI_CANH.md`

1. **Before anything else** in every session (answering, planning, or editing): read **`LUAT_VA_BOI_CANH.md`** at the repo root end-to-end and follow it. It overrides every other doc, including `huongdan.txt`.
2. Obey its working rules (section 5), especially: reply in Vietnamese, and **no code changes until the owner has agreed and the decision is recorded in section 6**.
3. When the owner agrees on a new rule or decision, update the matching section and append to section 9 (never delete history; mark superseded items instead). Never write real tokens or passwords.
4. `huongdan.txt` is the technical handoff (architecture, deploy). After code changes, append to its section `8) NHẬT KÝ THAY ĐỔI` and refresh section `7)` after pushing to `main`.
